              ::= { axSmc1snmp 21 }

          axSmc1snmpOutBadValues OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX      Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS  read-only
              STATUS      obsolete
              DESCRIPTION
                      "The total number of SNMP PDUs which were generated
