          axSmc2ipSystemStatsInReceives OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
                     "The total number of input IP datagrams received, including
                      those received in error.

                      Discontinuities in the value of this counter can occur at
