               necessarily the input interface for the messages."
              ::= { axSmc6ipv6IfIcmpEntry 1 }

          axSmc6ipv6IfIcmpInErrors OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
               "The number of ICMP messages which the interface
