              STATUS      current
              DESCRIPTION "The current Rate Control mode of operation of
                          the MAC sublayer of this interface."
              REFERENCE   "[IEEE 802.3 Std.], 30.3.1.1.34,
                          aRateControlStatus."
              ::= { axSmc11dot3StatsEntry 21 }

