                      `badValue'."
              ::= { axSmc16snmp 10 }

          axSmc16snmpInReadOnlys OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX      Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS  read-only
              STATUS      obsolete
              DESCRIPTION
                      "The total number valid SNMP PDUs which were delivered
