              ::= { axSmc17tcpConnectionEntry 4 }

          axSmc17tcpConnectionRemAddress OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     InetAddress
              MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
