                      ipSystemStatsDiscontinuityTime."
              ::= { axSmc18ipSystemStatsEntry 27 }

          axSmc18ipSystemStatsOutFragFails OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
