              ::= { axSmc20ipSystemStatsEntry 41 }

          axSmc20ipSystemStatsInBcastPkts OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
                     "The number of IP broadcast datagrams received.

