                      ipSystemStatsDiscontinuityTime."
              ::= { axSmc22ipSystemStatsEntry 30 }

          axSmc22ipSystemStatsHCOutTransmits OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter64
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
