                      ipSystemStatsDiscontinuityTime."
              ::= { axSmc26ipSystemStatsEntry 24 }

          axSmc26ipSystemStatsOutDiscards OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
                     "The number of output IP datagrams for which no problem was
