                      ipSystemStatsDiscontinuityTime."
              ::= { axSmc30ipSystemStatsEntry 27 }

          axSmc30ipSystemStatsOutFragFails OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
