          axSmc30ipv6IfStatsOutMcastPkts OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX      Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS  read-only
              STATUS      current
              DESCRIPTION
                 "The number of multicast packets transmitted
                  by the interface"
              ::= { axSmc30ipv6IfStatsEntry 20 }

--
