                      ipSystemStatsDiscontinuityTime."
              ::= { axSmc32ipSystemStatsEntry 25 }

          axSmc32ipSystemStatsOutFragReqds OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX     Counter32
              MAX-ACCESS read-only
              STATUS     current
              DESCRIPTION
